cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using these
  metadata. Cite Burns's thesis and the Copenhagen Ugaritic Corpus separately
  as appropriate.
type: software
title: "Ugarit Context Parsing (CTC-TF)"
abstract: >-
  Software for extracting contextual vocabulary from Duncan Coe Burns's
  Ugaritic Workbooks and materializing feature-only Text-Fabric modules over
  the Copenhagen Ugaritic Corpus (CUC). Source Workbooks, CUC data, and
  generated corpus modules are not distributed by this repository.
authors:
  - family-names: Sosnovshchenko
    given-names: Oleksandr
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexsosn/CTC-TF"
url: "https://github.com/alexsosn/CTC-TF"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Ugaritic
  - Text-Fabric
  - corpus linguistics
